From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sebberich <sebberich@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 09:27:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 30/33] Mobile: Pin and colour note tiles

Pinned notes come first in the tile view (with Pinned/Others labels and a
pin icon), and tiles can be tinted with one of ten colours that keep
4.5:1 text contrast in light, dark and OLED themes. Both are stored as
regular Joplin tags ("pinned", "color:<name>"), so they sync and are
visible on other devices. Actions are available in selection mode.

